* Trivial helper module for 68k syscall live-verification (F$Fork/F$Load/
* F$Link targets) -- mirrors the 6809 test suite's childprg.a. Exits
* immediately with a known status (77) so a parent's F$Wait can confirm
* it actually ran this code, not something else.
*
* Call-code/module-header constants and psect shape match
* dogfood-asm-line-counter.a (already Live-confirmed this project).
Prgrm set 1
Objct set 1
ReEnt set $80
Type_Lang set (Prgrm<<8)+Objct
Attr_Rev set (ReEnt<<8)+1
FExit set $06
*
 psect childprg68k,Type_Lang,Attr_Rev,0,400,start
start
 moveq #77,d1
 trap #0
 dc.w FExit
 ends
